      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──龙争虎斗。尚未出道便被视为最强等级而深受敬畏，古今\n无人能敌的“成田白仁”与热爱单挑的宿舍长“菱亚马逊”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea9ad7f9fe7397a79c099a683c51fabdae1aaf1c920c364c81e9c5b63bf4b6b0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
