    {
      "uid": "zhcn:167c05df243b1ccc12d9a534",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对方仅轻轻瞥了她一眼便离开了。\n甚至难以确定她是否有认识到前来搭话的赛马娘是何人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "594ae7a2c772dd8b777267aaf5c968d0eab481e0be176042787f3defe82a449d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
