      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "白仁真的好厉害呢！\n才稍微提振一点干劲就能拉开这么远的距离……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4aed60248a42dc33d0cd9f69fde7ba0a1475f3b84969a726dec582e105ea788a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
