      "uid": "zhcn:799d0378ccee221b87005029",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我不禁开口询问。难道这位无法奔跑的赛马娘\n将自己的梦想寄托在成田白仁身上？",
      "source_fingerprint": "34f301ae432a868d398da1e5cbcdb11719f94a216d357039c9d0ffa22a818b5b",
