      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她会怎么回答呢？“憧憬”、“目标”、“互相认识”。\n我脑中浮现各种可能的答案，但眼前少女最终说出的是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "573af0ecb4f4544477960c123327cbbfe82d3946deec3b4ab5acdd7388c0728c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
